#. module: kmessage_connector_account
#: model:kmessage.capability,description:kmessage_connector_account.capability_invoice_pdf
msgid ""
"Prints one invoice of the customer whose number is in the conversation and "
"returns the file. An invoice number that belongs to somebody else is "
"answered exactly as one that does not exist."
msgstr ""
"يطبع فاتورة واحدة للعميل صاحب الرقم في المحادثة ويُرجع الملف. ورقم "
"فاتورة تخصّ شخصاً آخر يُردّ عليه تماماً مثل رقم فاتورة غير موجودة."

